{
  "name": "Is Seville walkable?",
  "parent_id": 230624347930176,
  "group_id": "869855f1-b6a3-41b2-95b2-2124fe10404c",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-10-15T07:20:52.289Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T21:05:16.649Z",
  "published_at": "2026-11-10T21:05:16.623Z",
  "id": 230847497403086,
  "uuid": "1d9892bb-e2db-4572-850c-93aa4fb475b6",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "6a1c0b52-3f1e-4d8e-9a77-1b2c3d4e5f02",
    "answer": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Yes. The old centre is compact and flat. The Cathedral, the Real Alcázar and the Santa Cruz quarter sit within a short walk of each other.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Use a bus, tram or Sevici bike for Plaza de España and for longer trips in the heat.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question": "Is it walkable?",
    "component": "faq_item",
    "answer__i18n__de": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ja. Die Altstadt ist kompakt und flach. Die Kathedrale, der Real Alcázar und das Viertel Santa Cruz liegen nur einen kurzen Fußweg voneinander entfernt.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Nutze für die Plaza de España und für längere Strecken in der Hitze einen Bus, die Straßenbahn oder ein Sevici-Leihrad.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__es": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Sí. El casco antiguo es compacto y llano. La Catedral, el Real Alcázar y el barrio de Santa Cruz están a poca distancia a pie unos de otros.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Usa el autobús, el tranvía o una bici Sevici para ir a la Plaza de España y para los trayectos más largos con calor.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__fr": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Oui. Le centre ancien est compact et plat. La cathédrale, le Real Alcázar et le quartier de Santa Cruz se trouvent à courte distance à pied les uns des autres.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Prenez un bus, le tramway ou un vélo Sevici pour la Plaza de España et pour les trajets plus longs par forte chaleur.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question__i18n__de": "Ist es zu Fuß gut erkundbar?",
    "question__i18n__es": "¿Se puede recorrer a pie?",
    "question__i18n__fr": "Peut-on s'y déplacer à pied ?"
  },
